`parity dashboard` on a checkout with one recording (parity.in/): the
committed page matches the rendering; a stale page fails the check.

```console
$ xtask parity dashboard --root . --check
parity: ./docs/internal/parity.md is up to date

$ xtask parity dashboard --root . --out stale.md --check
? 1
parity: stale.md differs from the rendering: run `cargo xtask parity dashboard`

$ xtask parity summary
? 2
xtask parity: expected `parity dashboard`
...

```
